Thank you Professor for your suggestion.

My concern is that in this particular case
beta_{x}+ beta_{x,id2}) X; can also be mapped as

beta_{x}- constant + beta_{x,id2} + constant ) X; which might make the coefficients non identifiable. If I use const=F will that resolve this problem? I was thinking if the constraint is there we might resolve that problem.

Also why should we use scale.model= TRUE?

