I've got inla working on mac m3 homebrew.

1- install INLA from here
https://inla.r-inla-download.org/R/testing/bin/macosx/sonoma-arm64/contrib/4.3/

2- make symbolic link to

/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.3/site-library/INLA/bin/mac.arm64/libRblas.0.dylib
from

/Library/Frameworks/R.framework/Versions/4.3-arm64/Resources/libRblas.dylib

see
https://cran.r-project.org/bin/macosx/RMacOSX-FAQ.html#Which-BLAS-is-used-and-how-can-it-be-changed_003f

