seems like you have done the math wrong, the model is

	Z %*% z

so 'Z' must be n x m matrix, where n is the number of linear predictors, 56 in
your case, and the index, (x2 in your case) are integers in 1:m

you have

> dim( X[[1]][[1]])
[1] 56  1

so your m=1, meaning that your x2 must be from 1:m, ie the should all be 1 or
NA.

